@startuml
title Detailed Sequence Diagram: UC-07 Issue / Snag Logging
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Supervisor" as Sup
participant "MobileApp\n<<Flutter>>" as Mobile
participant "IssueController\n<<Node.js API>>" as API
database "MySQL\n<<Database>>" as DB
participant "S3Storage\n<<Cloud>>" as S3
participant "WebDashboard\n<<React>>" as Web
actor "Manager" as Mgr

== Part 1: Supervisor Reports Issue ==
Sup -> Mobile: Capture Issue Photo & Add Description
activate Mobile

Mobile -> S3: POST /upload (photo_file)
activate S3
S3 --> Mobile: return photoURL (HTTPS)
deactivate S3

Mobile -> API: POST /api/issues (description, photoURL)
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO Issues (ProjectID, Description, PhotoURL, Status='Open')
activate DB
DB --> API: return issueID
deactivate DB

API --> Mobile: HTTP 201 Created
deactivate API
Mobile --> Sup: Display "Issue Logged Successfully"
deactivate Mobile

== Part 2: Manager Resolves Issue ==
Mgr -> Web: View Open Issues
activate Web
Web -> API: GET /api/issues?status=open
API --> Web: return issueListJSON
Web --> Mgr: Render Issue List

Mgr -> Web: Click "Mark as Resolved" on Issue
Web -> API: PUT /api/issues/{issueID} (Status='Resolved')
activate API
API -> DB: UPDATE Issues SET Status='Resolved' WHERE ID={issueID}
activate DB
DB --> API: return success
deactivate DB

API --> Web: HTTP 200 OK
deactivate API
Web --> Mgr: Display "Issue Resolved"
deactivate Web

@enduml

